dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">The Facebook Lead Ads integration allows you to collect leads directly from Facebook Ads and have them automatically synced with your CRM. With this integration, you can easily capture contact information from potential customers interested in your products or services on Facebook and quickly follow up with them through your CRM. By automating the lead capture process, you can save time and improve the efficiency of your sales and marketing efforts.</span><br><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#What-is-the-Facebook-Lead-Ads-Integration?\">What is the Facebook Lead Ads Integration?</a><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Who-is-this-integration-helpful-for?\">Who is this integration helpful for?</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-are-the-benefits-of-this-integration?\">What are the benefits of this integration?</a></li></ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Pre-requisites-for-Facebook-Lead-Ads\">Pre-requisites for Facebook Lead Ads</a><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#To-create-custom-fields%3A\">To create custom fields:</a></li></ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-integrate-or-manage-Facebook-Leads-Ads-with-a-Sub-Account\">How to integrate or manage Facebook Leads Ads with a Sub-Account</a><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#To-setup-FB-integration%3A\">To setup FB integration:</a></li><li><a href=\"#To-disconnect-facebook-integration%3A\">To disconnect facebook integration:</a></li><li><a href=\"#To-Manage-Facebook-pages%3A\">To Manage Facebook pages:</a></li><li><a href=\"#To-perform-basic-troubleshooting-or-Sync-leads-manually%3A\">To perform basic troubleshooting or Sync leads manually:</a></li><li><a href=\"#To-enable-or-disable-facebook/instagram-messages%3A\">To enable or disable facebook/instagram messages:</a></li><li><a href=\"#To-manage-forms%3A\">To manage forms:</a></li></ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Other-facebook/instagram-related-support-guides%3A\">Other facebook/instagram related support guides:</a></li></ul><h1 data-identifyelement=\"550\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-the-Facebook-Lead-Ads-Integration?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.96875; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"551\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">What is the Facebook Lead Ads Integration?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"553\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">Integrating Facebook Lead Ads with CRM allows businesses to automatically capture leads and manage them in one platform. This streamlines lead management,\u2028eliminates manual errors, enhances lead quality, boosts conversions, and drives business growth.</span><span data-identifyelement=\"554\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"556\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"557\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Who-is-this-integration-helpful-for?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 2.25; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">Who is this integration helpful for?</span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"559\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"560\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">Integrating Facebook Lead Ads with CRM is ideal for businesses using Facebook Ads to generate leads and streamline their lead management. It\u2019s especially beneficial \u2028for small businesses or startups with limited sales teams, as it automates lead capture, saving time and resources while improving data accuracy. For businesses already using CRM, this integration ensures seamless lead import into existing workflows, enhancing follow-ups and maximizing efficiency.<br data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"562\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"563\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-are-the-benefits-of-this-integration?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 2.25; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"564\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">What are the benefits of this integration?</span></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"565\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"566\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">The benefits of integrating Facebook Lead Ads with the CRM include:</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"567\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 700;\">Automated lead capture:</span><span data-identifyelement=\"569\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;With this integration, businesses can automatically capture leads generated through Facebook Ads and import them into their CRM system, eliminating the need for manual data entry.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"570\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 700;\">Improved Lead Quality:</span><span data-identifyelement=\"572\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;By tracking and managing leads through CRM, businesses can better understand their audience, personalize their marketing efforts, and improve the overall quality of their leads.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 700;\">Enhanced lead management:</span><span data-identifyelement=\"575\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;The CRM system allows businesses to track and manage their leads in one place, providing a 360-degree view of their interactions with prospects and customers. This can help companies to streamline their sales and marketing efforts and improve customer retention.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 700;\">Efficient follow-up:</span><span data-identifyelement=\"578\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;With lead data automatically captured and imported into the CRM system, businesses can quickly follow up with leads and prioritize their sales efforts based on lead quality and behavior.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"579\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 15pt; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"580\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 700;\">Increased conversions:</span><span data-identifyelement=\"581\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Businesses can increase their conversions and ROI from Facebook Ads by automating lead capture and improving lead management.</span></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"582\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.96875; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><hr data-identifyelement=\"583\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page;\"></h2><h1 data-identifyelement=\"584\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Pre-requisites-for-Facebook-Lead-Ads\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.96875; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"585\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\">Pre-requisites for Facebook Lead Ads</span></h1><ul data-identifyelement=\"586\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text