ner is a JavaScript-based solution.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><code data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"594\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&lt;noscript&gt;</code></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;is designed for browsers that do not support JavaScript, and including it may unintentionally set cookies without user consent.</span></span></p><h3 data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"738\" id=\"Integrating-Marketing-Tools-with-Cookie-Consent\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"793\" data-start=\"742\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Integrating Marketing Tools with Cookie Consent</strong></span></span></h3><p data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"796\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">When integrating marketing tools with the cookie consent banner, you can check which cookie categories users have consented to. Follow the provided implementation guide for popular marketing tools.</span></span></p><h4 data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"997\" id=\"Implementation-Note:\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"1002\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Implementation Note:</strong></span></span></h4><p data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1029\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">The code below should replace your existing <strong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1073\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Meta Pixel, Google Tag Manager (GTM), or Google Analytics (GA)</strong> tracking codes. Insert it in the <strong data-end=\"1193\" data-start=\"1173\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">page header code</strong> or <strong data-end=\"1219\" data-start=\"1197\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">head tracking code</strong> settings for funnels, websites, or webinars. This template ensures proper integration with the cookie consent banner.</span></p></div><h2 data-block-id=\"block-afa7a646-dcd0-4704-8708-f6deaa124f37\" id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(52, 52, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: var(--editor-heading-font-weight, var(--cu-heading-weight)); font-stretch: inherit; font-size: calc(var(--editor-font-size) * 1.5); line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: var(--editor-font-family); font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; hyphens: auto; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br></h2><h2 data-block-id=\"block-afa7a646-dcd0-4704-8708-f6deaa124f37\" id=\"Facebook-pixel\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(52, 52, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: var(--editor-heading-font-weight, var(--cu-heading-weight)); font-stretch: inherit; font-size: calc(var(--editor-font-size) * 1.5); line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: var(--editor-font-family); font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; hyphens: auto; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s eas