" data-start=\"1722\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Ensure consistent image display across both desktop and mobile devices.</p></li><li data-end=\"1867\" data-start=\"1796\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1867\" data-start=\"1798\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Maintain a polished, branded look with logos, banners, and visuals.</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"1909\" data-start=\"1874\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-To-Setup-the-Image-Element\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How To Setup the Image Element</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"1994\" data-start=\"1911\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-