n the email layout.</p></li><li data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2400\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2493\" data-start=\"2403\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on the <strong data-end=\"2433\" data-start=\"2416\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Image Element</strong> to open the <strong data-end=\"2454\" data-start=\"2446\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Edit</strong> tab on the left panel. Here you can:</p><ul data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2497\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"2557\" data-start=\"2497\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2557\" data-start=\"2499\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2519\" data-start=\"2499\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Upload an Image:</strong> Choose an image from your computer.</p></li><li data-end=\"2637\" data-start=\"2561\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2637\" data-start=\"2563\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2584\" data-start=\"2563\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Use an Image URL:</strong> Paste a direct link to an externally hosted image.</p></li><li data-end=\"2722\" data-start=\"2641\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2722\" data-start=\"2643\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2669\" data-start=\"2643\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Adjust Width &amp; Height:</strong> Define custom dimensions or use automatic scaling.</p></li><li data-end=\"2800\" data-start=\"2726\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2800\" data-start=\"2728\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2728\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add a Link:</strong> Make your image clickable by adding a destination URL.</p></li><li data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2804\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2806\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2824\" data-start=\"2806\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Set Alignment:</strong> Align the image to the left, center, or right.</p></li><li data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2877\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2879\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"2895\" data-start=\"2879\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Padding:</strong> Control spacing around the image for better design balance.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057289695/original/5ULMgMtX99lLYUsvgAXpihAZikng-Fv51gaec0.png?1761904443\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155057289695\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\"></p></li></ul></li><li data-end=\"3076\" data-start=\"2958\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"3076\" data-start=\"2961\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">(Optional) Click the <strong data-end=\"2996\" data-start=\"2982\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Visibility</strong> tab to manage <strong data-end=\"3038\" data-start=\"3011\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Device-Based Visibility</strong> or <strong data-end=\"3065\" data-start=\"3042\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conditional Sending</strong> options.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057289798/original/ad6WgCPPL4DGdz-JTuhgaSNG-_ao81_g3gf9cf.png?1761904510\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155057289798\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\"></p></li><li data-end=\"3186\" data-start=\"3077\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"3186\" data-start=\"3080\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Preview your email on both <strong data-end=\"3118\" data-start=\"3107\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">desktop</strong> and <strong data-end=\"3133\" data-start=\"3123\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">mobile</strong> devices to confirm the image displays as expected.</p></li></ol><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-050a9542-2e1a-42f1-9c49-894ce943f862\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-4f587b08-c1b7-4f84-a20b-d7318047cbf6\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Which image file types are supported?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-06c310d0-8207-4545-b5a1-c4de5cc4abfd\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">You can upload or link common formats such as JPG, PNG, and GIF.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-d3639fae-6eeb-4b96-bb62-cdfe04b01655\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can I make an image clickable?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-af75120c-bafd-4a3c-b266-aab00647cfa8\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, add a hyperlink in the Redirection Link field to make the image interactive.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-b6007f9b-0661-45ae-a5e8-f8b359d29577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can I use an external image URL?</span></strong></p><p data-end=\"3756\" data-start=\"3603\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, simply paste a valid image URL into the Image URL field. Make sure the image is publicly accessible.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-47ca75fc-9e86-49cc-a782-b29c6b12f273\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Do Spacers affect email deliverability or loading speed?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ed8884d7-59df-441d-adf8-0e3982597048\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">No, Spacers are lightweight and do not impact deliverability or loading times.</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ed8884d7-59df-441d-adf8-0e3982597048\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-e45c01f0-639f-4b6f-a9a6-567343047052\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: How can I delete an image?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ff5fcb29-a88a-409f-a835-ca346647c3f0\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Simply click on the Image Element and use the delete/trash icon to remove it from your layout.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003060-appointment-booking-conversation-ai-workflow-action", "title": "Calendar", "folder": "Conversation AI", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7c40331e-d282-4089-8558-cda139a6f553\" dir=\"ltr\">Utilize the new \"Appointment Booking Conversation AI\" workflow action to harness the power of AI and book appointments for you and your clients</div><p><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In This Article</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Components-of-the-Workflow-Action\">Components of the Workflow Action</a><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Calendar\">Calendar</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Personality-and-Additional-Instructions\">Personality and Additional Instructions</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Maximum-Messages-Limit-before-it-goes-to-\">Maximum Messages Limit before it goes to \"APPOINTMENT NOT BOOKED\"</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Time-Out-Value-and-Unit\">Time Out Value and Unit</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Channel\">Channel</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Don't-let-the-bot-send-confirmation-message\">Don't let the bot send confirmation message</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-32b531eb-24af-4176-8084-565e3d857873\" dir=\"ltr\">Understand the components of the Workflow Action to configure the AI bot as per your needs</div><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Components-of-the-Workflow-Action\">Components of the Workflow Action</h1><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-0cb409f4-122b-4fe0-b644-425440b455bd\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Calendar\">Calendar</h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-29ed64d9-9605-4fc2-aba8-98ec3640902d\" dir=\"ltr\">This Calendar will be used to fetch available slots and suggest them to the contact and once selected by the contact, the appointment will be booked on this calendar.</div><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">Recurring calendars are not supported</pre><p><br></p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-6ee78072-7027-4dfa-8218-fcc725d845d5\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Personality-and-Additional-Instructions\">Personality and Additional Instructions</h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7c448028-7d17-4b81-9d24-6adb2fa43256\" dir=\"ltr\">Use these prompt boxes to add personality and instructions to the AI to best suit your brand voice and increase the probability of getting the appointment booked</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-a8d0d245-0aa0-4c4f-9273-e4de3314af61\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><p><br></p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-6ee78072-7027-4dfa-8218-fcc725d845d5\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Maximum-Messages-Limit-before-it-goes-to-&quot;APPOINTMENT-NOT-BOOKED&quot;\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Maximum Messages Limit before it goes to \"APPOINTMENT NOT BOOKED\"</h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0d78df87-c4a3-4752-a2a3-e2484207478e\" dir=\"ltr\">This is the maximum number of messages within which the AI bot will try to book an appointment and it it fails, it will send the contact down the \"Appointment not Booked\" branch.</div><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">Maximum limit is 25 and minimum is 5. Recomended value for this field is 15</pre><p><br></p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-c48a203a-5893-4632-b80c-868904af44a5\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Time-Out-Value-and-Unit\">Time Out Value and Unit</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">The time for which the AI bot waits for the contact to respond back to its answer. If the contact doesn't respond in the specified time, the contact is sent down the \"Time Out\" branch.&nbsp;</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Use \"GoTo\" action in the Time Out branch and send the contact back to the same action to make the AI bot followup with the contact</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Channel\">Channel</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">The conversation channel on which the AI bot will respond to the contact. Current support Channels are SMS, WhatsApp, FB and IG</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Don't-let-the-bot-send-confirmation-message\">Don't let the bot send confirmation message</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">By default, the AI bot sends the booking confirmation message (Example: Great, you are booked for 12th August at 6pm) once an appointment is booked. Checking this box will stop the AI bot from sending the confirmation message and the contact will directly be sent down the \"Appointment Booked\" branch as soon as appointment is booked</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">If enabled, Dont forget to add a confirmation message in the \"Appointment Booked\" branch to inform the contact of the progress and keep the conversation going</pre><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001226976", "title": "LC Phone System Trust Center", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009573/original/jUA6Qwo4lpmKfpmMlaN07XM_0tgoUcdNHw93db.png?1741675724", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009596/original/r8ITZXT42KpzSZ9wDinWik75bo0DDQkhdA3150.jpg?1741675729", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009590/original/u0F6zrEz3m04VIz7apYGARF0mfjFshJrXg3150.jpg?1741675729", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009592/original/8BLfRkRijsqAmUrtcesga5IsdBjjLZXArw3150.jpg?1741675729", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009564/original/EiHcbiCpZDIxs8PjE0Rn3Rkif7owCof02A6811.jpg?1741675713", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009588/original/yP5wrfjTXPG8WGATt9eFm_CyOIYS0f8V9g3150.jpg?1741675729", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009566/original/-l55aPLrGg2bgeuQcXNa1htLdEJQgY1JAAe214.png?1741675714", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009562/original/P19dUiTQ-q4PfutH5rvdwjrBXLfH3C04ew1c45.jpg?1741675712", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009589/original/LXgAOCCJlgmO0sDapna-JWbVr_3jtK92mA3150.jpg?1741675729", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009575/original/jOPBycblF7VLpofNBrnRlflHspgKxBq5VQ0767.png?1741675727", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009569/original/qb0JnJnbr5RVOhWPkfYkKeopM2shr-tG0gbd1a.png?1741675720", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009558/original/OOqRiuXD16nOHWID98cot69gxOjPx8Cp1gd9b5.png?1741675711", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009570/original/JEoyFD0QHU4MIh7rp1U0NloUUVJl_Gh3aA53cc.jpg?1741675722", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009583/original/aVpL3Uej_5ysnUY-ZagK0l3JHym5Im-VQA1b88.png?1741675728", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043009567/original/Ok3bYi38HPvpxJkGKHEYIcnx6z8k7D0hEw9d63.png?1741675717"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"493\" dir=\"ltr\"><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(224, 30, 90); font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong>Starting August 31, 2023, all A2P messages sent from unregistered ten-digit long code numbers (Local and National numbers) to US numbers will be blocked.</strong></b></p><p data-identifyelement=\"493\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"493\" dir=\"ltr\">Carriers are becoming increasingly sensitive to spam and AUP enforcement when it comes to SMS and Calls. To keep spamming in check and to protect the end customer (leads/contacts) they have created various regulations &amp; compliance frameworks.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\">This article will help explain which compliance you or your client may need and how to get them.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(44, 92, 197); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">Best Practice for Brand Registration - \n<a href=\"155000000766-a2p-10dlc-brand-approval-best-practices.html\">https://help.leadconnectorhq.com/support/solutions/articles/155000000766-a2p-10dlc-brand-approval-best-practices</a><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/48001229784-a2p-10dlc-campaign-approval-best-practices\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\"></a></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(44, 92, 197); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">Best Practice for Campaign Submission - \n<a href=\"155000000174-a2p-10dlc-campaign-approval-best-practices.html\">https://help.leadconnectorhq.com/support/solutions/articles/155000000174-a2p-10dlc-campaign-approval-best-practices</a></pre><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"519\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; user-select: none; clear: both; break-after: page; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h1 class=\"tdfocus-1669904994053\" data-identifyelement=\"552\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"256\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Trust Center</strong><strong data-identifyelement=\"257\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</strong></h1><p class=\"tdfocus-1669905019850\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"258\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1669905019850\" data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"259\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Trust Center</strong> provides products that can improve customer engagement by increasing throughput and brand recognition.</p><ul data-identifyelement=\"260\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"741\" data-identifyelement=\"261\" data-start=\"621\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If you send SMS to US numbers, registering for <strong data-end=\"683\" data-identifyelement=\"262\" data-start=\"670\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">A2P 10DLC</strong> (Application-to-Person 10-Digit Long Code) is required.</li><li data-end=\"842\" data-iden