ont-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">A: Partial payments can be enabled for all calendar types - Event, Round Robin, Collective, Class, Service Calendar and Service Menu.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Q: How do I manage pending payments?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">A: Pending payments can be managed manually through the Payments &gt; Invoices tab. Users can view the pending amount and collect it from the booker accordingly.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Q: Will bookers receive a notification about pending payments?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">A: No, bookers will not be notified about pending payments. However, the staff members can check the pending amount under Payments &gt; Invoices.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Q: Which payment gateways are supported for calendar payments?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">A: Currently, the supported payment gateways for calendar payments are Stripe and Authorize.net.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003968-connecting-multiple-facebook-pages-to-your-account", "title": "Connecting multiple Facebook pages to your account", "folder": "Facebook", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059804/original/e7FSaLLnj5xgfPe-kLFHCYP1HqO1yZpgNg3de3.png?1729488858", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059933/original/PFZn4-GyKGBJVee4HhFBvtyC8LgeW06_sQ5fa4.png?1729489096", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059978/original/ObtRkrwAWQ4QIwBbenlp5s7nZYLBYDNfvA638c.png?1729489220", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061463/original/9ikL0ynstvJ3pblYo6uqFXBU58cQtIbY1Qc24e.png?1729491521", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061456/original/Bld6_kC9DKsXWu4gjY-UEMIWNXw8tlsCWg24fc.png?1729491507", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061604/original/Bob8Y6YN09Zz5kOaOEOWIXQbvgWwzERZeg95cb.png?1729491671", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061583/original/JJwmX6ofRx6Aa8-svzhs6h6YE0HxUM1cZAaa67.png?1729491657", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061822/original/DCZoijxdN99Pur8rT5m3XwCyJhH2mS90pQ484f.png?1729491950", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061909/original/mgQVEKBavM_8zxsWKJ1vl4fzCt1uCbGz-w3bb5.png?1729492022", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061932/original/aJp-9TwYjoqconI5ATIE3OhziSzREuLqqgf2b9.png?1729492033"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">This feature is currently available in Labs. Enable the feature in labs to connect multiple Facebook pages to your account.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 class=\"fd-toc\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></h2><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-can-I-achieve-with-this-feature?\">What can I achieve with this feature?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-do-I-connect-multiple-pages?\">How do I connect multiple pages?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Facebook-Integrations---Manage-pages\">Facebook Integrations - Manage pages</a></li><li><a href=\"#Facebook-Integrations---Settings\">Facebook Integrations - Settings</a></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-can-I-achieve-with-this-feature?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">What can I achieve with this feature?</strong></h2><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Leads Sync</strong>: Sync leads automatically from Facebook Lead Ads across multiple pages with clear attribution to the source</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Conversations</strong>: Chat with customers <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">across multiple Facebook pages&nbsp;</span>using Facebook and Instagram chat integrations&nbsp;</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Automation</strong>: Build customised workflows to automate customer engagement across multiple Facebook pages</li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Reputation</strong>: Manage reviews and your review responses across multiple Facebook pages</li></ul><p><br></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-do-I-connect-multiple-pages?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How do I connect multiple pages?</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 1</strong>: After enabling the feature in Labs, navigate to Settings &gt; Integrations.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059804/original/e7FSaLLnj5xgfPe-kLFHCYP1HqO1yZpgNg3de3.png?1729488858\" style=\"width: 434px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035059804\">&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 2</strong>: Click on 'Connect', login to your Facebook account and approve all required permissions for LeadConnector to integrate with your Facebook account.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059933/original/PFZn4-GyKGBJVee4HhFBvtyC8LgeW06_sQ5fa4.png?1729489096\" style=\"width: 497px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035059933\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 3</strong>: Select the pages that you wish to integrate.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">You may choose to sync new leads only, or also sync previous 90 days' leads to start with.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035059978/original/ObtRkrwAWQ4QIwBbenlp5s7nZYLBYDNfvA638c.png?1729489220\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035059978\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Step 4</strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">: Map your Facebook Lead Ad form fields to Contacts' custom fields.</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061463/original/9ikL0ynstvJ3pblYo6uqFXBU58cQtIbY1Qc24e.png?1729491521\" style=\"width: 257px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061463\"></span><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061456/original/Bld6_kC9DKsXWu4gjY-UEMIWNXw8tlsCWg24fc.png?1729491507\" style=\"width: 718px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061456\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061604/original/Bob8Y6YN09Zz5kOaOEOWIXQbvgWwzERZeg95cb.png?1729491671\" style=\"width: 417px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061604\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"Facebook-Integrations---Manage-pages\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Integrations - Manage pages</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">You can manage the pages that wish you integrate by clicking on Manage pages and selecting/unselecting as per your preference. For example, if you don't wish to integrate one of the pages, you can unselect them in the Manage Pages menu.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061583/original/JJwmX6ofRx6Aa8-svzhs6h6YE0HxUM1cZAaa67.png?1729491657\" style=\"width: 299px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061583\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061822/original/DCZoijxdN99Pur8rT5m3XwCyJhH2mS90pQ484f.png?1729491950\" style=\"width: 541px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061822\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2 id=\"Facebook-Integrations---Settings\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Facebook Integrations - Settings</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\">You can manage the messaging capability across your integrated pages using the settings button. For example, if you don't wish to use one of the pages for messaging/chat, you can choose to disable the setting on that page.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061909/original/mgQVEKBavM_8zxsWKJ1vl4fzCt1uCbGz-w3bb5.png?1729492022\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155035061909\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: 299px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155035061932/original/aJp-9TwYjoqconI5ATIE3OhziSzREuLqqgf2b9.png?1729492033\" style=\"width: 331px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155035061932\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005483-how-to-setup-google-ad-conversion-action", "title": "How to setup Google 